  "cli_result_text": "Submitted the 13 files most relevant to the dependency-graph analysis:\n\n**Log4j2 (bridge module / provider mechanism):**\n- `log4j-api/src/main/java/org/apache/logging/log4j/LogManager.java` \u2014 selects the highest-priority `Provider` at static-init time\n- `log4j-api/src/main/java/org/apache/logging/log4j/util/ProviderUtil.java` \u2014 loads `Provider`s via `ServiceLoader` (`META-INF/services/org.apache.logging.log4j.spi.Provider`)\n- `log4j-api/src/main/java/org/apache/logging/log4j/spi/Provider.java` \u2014 the `Provider` model class (priority, `LoggerContextFactory`)\n- `log4j-to-slf4j/src/main/java/org/apache/logging/slf4j/SLF4JProvider.java` \u2014 priority 15 binding to SLF4J\n- `log4j-to-slf4j/src/main/resources/META-INF/services/org.apache.logging.log4j.spi.Provider` \u2014 service registration for `SLF4JProvider`\n- `log4j-to-slf4j/pom.xml` \u2014 module dependency declarations (log4j-api + slf4j-api)\n- `log4j-core/src/main/java/org/apache/logging/log4j/core/impl/Log4jProvider.java` \u2014 priority 10 binding, competes with SLF4JProvider\n- `log4j-core/src/main/resources/META-INF/services/org.apache.logging.log4j.spi.Provider` \u2014 service registration for `Log4jProvider`\n- `log4j-api/pom.xml` \u2014 API module manifest\n\n**Spring Boot (logging auto-configuration):**\n- `spring-boot-project/spring-boot/src/main/java/org/springframework/boot/logging/log4j2/Log4J2LoggingSystem.java` \u2014 detects Log4j2 via `org.apache.logging.log4j.core.impl.Log4jContextFactory` classpath presence\n- `spring-boot-project/spring-boot/src/main/java/org/springframework/boot/logging/LoggingSystem.java` \u2014 abstraction/factory dispatch\n- `spring-boot-project/spring-boot/src/main/java/org/springframework/boot/context/logging/LoggingApplicationListener.java` \u2014 triggers `LoggingSystem.get()` during startup\n- `spring-boot-project/spring-boot/src/main/resources/META-INF/spring.factories` \u2014 registers the ordered `LoggingSystemFactory` chain (Logback \u2192 Log4j2 \u2192 JUL)",
